      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَسْعِيفٌ</span></b>  The <i>mixing</i> of musk and the like
<i>with aromatic perfumes</i> (K, TA) <i>and sweetscented oils.</i> (TA.) One says, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَعِّفْ لِى دُهْنِى</span>
[<i>Mix thou for me my oil with aromatic perfumes</i>]. (ISh, TA.)

